1.  Remove the outer `<article>` wrapper around the content inside `<main>`.
2.  Ensure `<main>` contains direct child elements for sections or articles.
3.  Verify that all other semantic tags (`nav`, `aside`, `footer`, `header`) remain outside the `<main>` to prevent confusion between navigation and content.

