      WCAG 2.2.1 Compliance Strategy:
      Instead of forcing the refresh, we provide a user-controlled toggle.
      Users can choose to enable auto-refresh if they need it (e.g., for live feeds),
      or disable it entirely. This satisfies the "Timing Adjustable" criterion.
    -->

